                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2569: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Commissioner in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-08-21T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 21,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3. Your 10, August 18, 2 p.m.</p>
                <p>You are authorized to make the modification in the third sentence of Article 1 of
                    draft convention suggested by Señor de Castro.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
